+ Gamma version released by Ikoda.

=========================================
= Version: Quantum Star SE 2.2.0 RC-1   =
= Release Date: 7 August 2004           =
=========================================

03 August 2004
--------------

+ added a small fix to remove a negative user amount cheat in /includes/ship_loading.inc.php (thanks Superfrog!)
+ fixed an auto fleet-delete bug where an SQL query was malformed because of single quotes retained in an array's key name.
+ altered the clan_relation lookups in find_designation function of user.inc.php to fetch one column rather than the entire row + will speed up this frequent request substantially.
+ removed db query executions from login_form unless user's login_id is present in PHP Session array + save time
+ altered a "default" check (i.e. no express use of isset/empty) on $bad_config, in install.php to prevent the script blocking the remaining installation process in circumstance where PHP fails to get the correct value for register_globals from its configuration



21 July 2004
------------

+ added some additional code to fleet_command.php to automatically delete empty fleets after a transfer of ships
+ login process contains code to enable logins without javascript enabled + this is invalid as game requires javascript, as a result the non-javascript code has been removed as an added security precaution.
+ added code to ship_combat.php to automatically delete defeated empty fleets after a battle (untested)
+ Bilkos has been disabled from earth.php and port.php + file removed to non-distributed obsolete directory
+ Page title block added to earth menu + earth.php line 116-117
+ Finbarrs has been removed from the game (temporarily like Bilkos)
+ create_server.php, create_game.php amended to use correct reference to Q-LIB backend





=========================================
= Version: Quantum Star SE 2.2.0 Beta-3 =
= Release Date: 20 July 2004            =
=========================================

16 July + 19 July 2004
----------------------

+ oddly the ship_build.php bug was not present in the code after I double checked + very strange
+ updated hourly_maint.php mining code to correctly make the mine mode value equal the current iterations resource_id correctly when selecting ships mining a resource. + thanks to programmermatt
+ amended hourly_maint.php to add a database query to add taxation amount to a planet's cash + a mod on matt's solution.
+ amended daily_maint.php to make $planet global in the Produce_Fighters() function + programmermatt spotted the error, however a global call on $planet makes the later adjustment to the $planet array take effect with ref.
+ minor daily_maint.php update (based on guess who? yes? programmermatt's report). Error ignored all inactive players if id's less than 6 + updated to check all player with id > 2 (Admin and Server Admin accounts)
+ again due to matt :) amendment to hourly_maint.php to increment launch pad building by 0.5 hours rather than 1 hr
+ on above + change in launch_pad field of QUANTUM_planets in SQL schema to use FLOAT rather than INTEGER to support decimal values.
+ fixed the location.php page Mining notification + yes, matt's a genius...:)
+ it's getting old, matt + fixed some questionable html syntax in location.php for Subspace Warps, fixed formatting while there and resolved a possible name conflict.
+ updated most of the mining.php links to pass the "overview" variable so overview is displayed immediately.



3 July + 15 July 2004
---------------------

+ common.inc.php exported to an include file common_funcs.inc.php in /includes/
+ amended user.inc.php and common.inc.php to enable use of new include file
+ transferred most of the backend functions to the new Q-LIB library directory
+ several minor updates to db_funcs.inc.php in /admin/includes/ to reflect the standard Q-LIB version
+ Q-LIB updated to version 0.0.2b (as amended for QS quirks) + will eventually mirror same library in Shadows Rising RPG Engine 0.0.3
+ amended misc files for relation field name changes + additional changes still required to finalise Postgres compatibility of these QS areas
+ Smarty configuration script updated, Smarty engine now available within QS + no templates until 2.3.0 :(
+ minor amendment to update link to ADOdb from login_form.php to reflect website location change.


